           "<p>We see this layout all over town: bungalows in Glendale and Southridge, the newer homes in Hickory Hills, and older one-storey houses in downtown Tillsonburg. The same plan suits homes out in Courtland and Delhi, where a quiet outdoor unit matters less to the neighbours and more to you on the back porch.</p>"
